// ---- name / type resolution pass (root: _.pw) ----
//
// Module-scoped name lookup, visibility, overload/exhaustiveness checks, local
// scopes, and expression type recovery. Split across `Resolve/` for readability;
// all parts share the module scope, so the split is purely organizational.

part ./Resolve/Module
part ./Resolve/Global
part ./Resolve/TypeRecovery
part ./Resolve/Locals
part ./Resolve/Expr
part ./Resolve/Operator
part ./Resolve/ExprType
part ./Resolve/MatchBind
